// ============================================================
//  TIRES — catalog data
//  Source: supplier price lists (2026). One row per size.
//
//  HOW TO ADD OR EDIT A TIRE
//  Copy a line, change the values, give it a new id.
//
//    id        unique, "tire-<number>" — never reuse a number
//    brand     e.g. "Winrun"
//    model     e.g. "R330"
//    size      full size string, e.g. "175/70R13"
//    width     the 175 in 175/70R13   (number)
//    aspect    the 70  in 175/70R13   (number, or null on sizes
//              written like 185R14C that have no aspect ratio)
//    diameter  the 13  in 175/70R13   (number)
//    category  e.g. "All-Terrain" — drives the Category filter
//    price     peso amount as a number
//    img       path under assets/images/tires/...
//
//  width / aspect / diameter must match the size string — the
//  Tread, Sidewall and Rim Size filters read those numbers.
//
//  After editing, bump DATA_VERSION in db.js so browsers pick up
//  the change instead of serving their cached copy.
// ============================================================

